<p><a href="https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0601/2025-12/AArch64-Registers/CNTP-CTL-EL0--Counter-timer-Physical-Timer-Control-Register?lang=en" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0601/2025-12/AArch64-Registers/CNTP-CTL-EL0--Counter-timer-Physical-Timer-Control-Register?lang=en</a></p>
